MajorDuties:
As a INTELLIGENCE SPECIALIST (CHIEF OF STAFF) you will be responsible for the following duties: - Reviewing, assigning and tracking tasks assigned from DCSA HQ, other agency directorates and DoD organizations using the Correspondence and Task Management System (CATMS);
- Coordinating with DCSA HQ and other internal organizations to ensure effective communications are maintained and CI interests are represented; - Developing, coordinating, and tracking internal and external staff actions to ensure timely, efficient actions are processed within established guidance and processes; - Working with senior staff members, action officers, managers, team leaders, and operating officials to ensure proper response to CI actions and to resolve or mitigate both short and long term issues;
- Leading initiatives within CI to ensure effective cross-agency integration for risk-based analysis and mitigation decisions.
